<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>موقع القرآن الكريم والمحاضرات</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri:wght@700&family=Cairo:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-deep: #04120a;
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(145deg, #05190e 0%, #0d301d 50%, #13462a 100%);
            --box-bg: rgba(13, 48, 29, 0.85);
            --gold: #f8efba;
            --gold-bright: #ffdf00;
            --gold-border: rgba(248, 239, 186, 0.5);
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #b8c5bc;
            --glow-gold: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 223, 0, 0.25);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-deep);
            background-image: var(--bg-gradient);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .main-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d301d 0%, #175232 100%);
            color: var(--gold);
            padding: 35px 20px;
            border-radius: 26px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), var(--glow-gold), inset 0 0 25px rgba(248, 239, 186, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border: 2px solid var(--gold-border);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            position: relative;
        }

        .main-header h1 {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            font-size: 34px;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            text-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
        }

        .main-header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .grid-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .nav-card {
            background: var(--box-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            padding: 22px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-border);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-light);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        .nav-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.02);
            border-color: var(--gold-bright);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(255, 223, 0, 0.35), var(--glow-gold);
            background: rgba(19, 70, 42, 0.95);
        }

        .nav-icon {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: rgba(248, 239, 186, 0.12);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(248, 239, 186, 0.3);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(248, 239, 186, 0.1);
        }

        .nav-title {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            font-size: 21px;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .full-width-box {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            background: var(--box-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            padding: 22px;
            border-radius: 22px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-border);
            box-sizing: border-box;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .full-width-box h3 {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 23px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .sub-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d301d 0%, #15452b 100%);
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-border);
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            font-size: 19px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        audio {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .custom-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #175232;
            color: var(--gold);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-border);
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
        }

        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="main-header">
        <h1>موقع القرآن الكريم والمحاضرات</h1>
        <p>منصة مباركة لخدمة العلوم الشرعية</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-container">
        <!-- المقالات -->
        <a href="/articles" class="nav-card">
            <div class="nav-icon">📝</div>
            <h2 class="nav-title">المقالات</h2>
        </a>

        <!-- الصوتيات -->
        <a href="/audio" class="nav-card">
            <div class="nav-icon">🎧</div>
            <h2 class="nav-title">الصوتيات</h2>
        </a>

        <!-- الفتاوى -->
        <a href="/fatwas" class="nav-card">
            <div class="nav-icon">💡</div>
            <h2 class="nav-title">الفتاوى</h2>
        </a>

        <!-- الكتب والرسائل -->
        <a href="/books" class="nav-card">
            <div class="nav-icon">📚</div>
            <h2 class="nav-title">الكتب والرسائل</h2>
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="full-width-box">
        <h3>آخر الصوتيات والمحاضرات</h3>
        <div class="sub-card">
            <% if (locals.latestAudio) { %>
                <div style="color: var(--gold); font-weight: bold;">🔊 <%= latestAudio.title %></div>
                <audio controls>
                    <source src="<%= latestAudio.url %>" type="audio/mpeg">
                    متصفحك لا يدعم مشغل الصوت
                </audio>
                <div>
                    <a href="<%= latestAudio.url %>" target="_blank" class="custom-btn">📥 تحميل المقطع</a>
                </div>
            <% } else { %>
                <div style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 16px;">لا توجد مقاطع صوتية مرفوعة حالياً</div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-note">
        جميع الحقوق محفوظة © 2026
    </div>

</body>
</html>
